{%- comment -%}
  A woman in a sun hat strolling across the bottom of the screen with her
  handbag, echoing the figure in the MERAVO banner.

  She lives in the fixed background layer, behind every product and every
  word, and the layer is clipped, so she can never cover anything or make
  the page scroll sideways. Her stride is CSS (walker-* in theme.css): legs
  and arms swing from hip and shoulder, the bag swings from her hand, and
  she rises slightly as each leg passes under her.

  Visitors whose device asks for less motion see her standing still.
  Theme settings > Brand > Walking figure.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="walker" style="--walker-opacity: {{ settings.walker_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};">
  <div class="walker-bob">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 124 256" class="h-full w-auto" focusable="false">
      <ellipse class="walker-shadow" cx="62" cy="246" rx="26" ry="4" fill="#4a1520" opacity="0.18"/>

      {%- comment -%} Far side: leg and arm behind the coat. {%- endcomment -%}
      <g class="walker-leg walker-leg-back">
        <rect x="58" y="148" width="8.5" height="88" rx="4.25" fill="#4a1520"/>
        <path d="M55 233 h13 q7 0 8 6 h-21 z" fill="#4a1520"/>
      </g>
      <g class="walker-arm walker-arm-back">
        <rect x="58.5" y="78" width="7" height="56" rx="3.5" fill="#611c2b"/>
        <circle cx="62" cy="136" r="3.6" fill="#e9bfae"/>
      </g>

      {%- comment -%} Long hair falls behind her shoulders. {%- endcomment -%}
      <path d="M53 52 Q48 70 47 88 Q46 100 52 104 Q56 92 58 80 Q57 66 60 56 Z" fill="#4a1520"/>

      {%- comment -%} Near leg. {%- endcomment -%}
      <g class="walker-leg walker-leg-front">
        <rect x="58" y="148" width="9" height="88" rx="4.5" fill="#611c2b"/>
        <path d="M55 233 h13 q7 0 8 6 h-21 z" fill="#4a1520"/>
      </g>

      {%- comment -%} Belted coat. {%- endcomment -%}
      <path d="M51 76 Q62 71 73 76 L77 118 L86 166 Q62 173 38 166 L47 118 Z" fill="#7a2436"/>
      <path d="M57 76 L62 94 L67 76 Q62 74 57 76 Z" fill="#8f2f40"/>
      <rect x="45" y="114" width="33" height="4.5" rx="2.25" fill="#4a1520"/>
      <path d="M62 118 L62 168" stroke="#611c2b" stroke-width="1.2"/>

      {%- comment -%} Neck, head, face. {%- endcomment -%}
      <rect x="59" y="64" width="7" height="12" rx="3" fill="#e9bfae"/>
      <circle cx="63" cy="57" r="10.5" fill="#f3d2c4"/>
      <path d="M73 56 l2.6 3.4 l-2.8 0.8 z" fill="#f3d2c4"/>
      <circle cx="68.2" cy="55.6" r="1.1" fill="#4a1520"/>
      <path d="M67 61.6 q2 1 3.6 -0.2" stroke="#b34a5c" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
      <path d="M53.5 54 Q55 47 63 46.5 Q70 47 73 52 Q65 50 58 56 Z" fill="#4a1520"/>

      {%- comment -%} Wide-brim sun hat with a band. {%- endcomment -%}
      <path d="M51 49 Q52 35 63 34 Q74 35 75 49 Z" fill="#c9a15a"/>
      <rect x="51" y="44.5" width="24" height="4" fill="#7a2436"/>
      <ellipse cx="63" cy="49.5" rx="23" ry="4.4" fill="#c9a15a"/>

      {%- comment -%} Near arm, carrying the handbag. {%- endcomment -%}
      <g class="walker-arm walker-arm-front">
        <rect x="59" y="78" width="7.5" height="57" rx="3.75" fill="#8f2f40"/>
        <circle cx="62.7" cy="137" r="3.8" fill="#f3d2c4"/>
        <g class="walker-bag">
          <path d="M54.5 141 Q62.7 127 71 141" stroke="#96692b" stroke-width="2.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <rect x="50" y="140" width="25.5" height="20" rx="4.5" fill="#c9a15a"/>
          <rect x="50" y="140" width="25.5" height="7.5" rx="3.5" fill="#b8863d"/>
          <circle cx="62.7" cy="148" r="1.7" fill="#96692b"/>
        </g>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
</div>
